      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Jardine sits in the Bear Gulch drainage of the Gallatin Range, close enough to Yellowstone’s gateway to benefit from tourism yet remote enough to keep a mining feel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
